  <History Date="13-06-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="23-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from Terbly OV370Z-R" />
  <History Date="28-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from Elation Platinum Wash ZXF Pro XL" />
  <History Date="28-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from Clay Paky A.leda K20" />
  <History Date="28-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from Clay Paky A.leda Wash K10" />
  <History Date="30-10-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Added RGBW Masters. Readded cells with attribute links and layout in extended mode, and removed zoom attribute." />
  <History Date="27-10-13" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased 16-bit functions to 2dp.  Standardised shutted function order." />
  <History Date="27-10-13" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added detailed functions to Colour Macro and Function attributes." />
  <History Date="27-10-13" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed shape mode.  Added Extended RGBW mode." />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="21-11-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed dimmer locate in response to bug report.  Added physical pan/tilt ranges." />
  <History Date="21-11-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added channel counts to mode names.  Added discreet functions to CTO." />
  <History Date="21-11-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Moved all shape attributes into effect group and wheel slots.  Revised function function names and added macros." />
  <History Date="21-11-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Removed rot arcs shape (not available on K5)" />
  <History Date="15-02-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added RDM ID's" />
